GAL16V8
VJIOR5

IORQn A2 A3 A4 A5 A6 A7 RESETn M1n GND
PICINT PICCSn PPICSn UARTCSn IORESET INTn INTAn GND0 NC VCC

; Four-port decode granularity follows the available A2-A7 inputs. Peripheral
; A0/A1 pins select registers inside each window.
/PICCSn  = /IORQn * /A7 * /A6 * /A5 * /A4 * /A3 * /A2
/PPICSn  = /IORQn * /A7 * /A6 * /A5 * /A4 * /A3 *  A2
/UARTCSn = /IORQn * /A7 * /A6 * /A5 * /A4 *  A3 * /A2

IORESET = /RESETn

; The shared bus interrupt is open-drain: drive only zero while PIC_INT is high.
INTn.T = GND
INTn.E = PICINT

/INTAn = /M1n * /IORQn

DESCRIPTION

VJUGA rev B I/O-card U2 selects, reset polarity, INTA and open-drain INT.
